    {
      "reviewerId": "114677325335944355431",
      "reviewerUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114677325335944355431?hl=id",
      "name": "Robin Whittenberg",
      "reviewerNumberOfReviews": 74,
      "isLocalGuide": true,
      "reviewerPhotoUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJzXPOmYtPrBbKPYtqzRjAHJu0DLjktLS-QBOfFCmYiihG-ZQ=s1920-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",
      "text": "Great mix of antiques, and handcrafted treasures and vintage goods at reasonable prices. Friendly talented  owner's. We just stopped by  for the first time since covid started and it was like being with old friends.  Definitely stop by here . It's worth the trip! 😇❣️.                  Stopped by again  yesterday for a visit. So good to see Deb. As usual we found lots of good treasures. Deb has been busy felting and has lots of great felted gnomes and other wonderful critters. She always remembers us and even puts aside things she knows that we collect and saves them for us!  They are now open year-round It's absolutely worth the stop.",
      "textTranslated": "Campuran barang antik, harta karun buatan tangan, dan barang-barang vintage yang luar biasa dengan harga terjangkau. Pemiliknya ramah dan berbakat. Kami baru pertama kali mampir sejak Covid dimulai dan rasanya seperti bertemu teman lama. Pasti mampir ke sini. Layak dikunjungi! 😇❣️. Mampir lagi kemarin untuk berkunjung. Senang bertemu Deb. Seperti biasa, kami menemukan banyak harta karun yang bagus. Deb sibuk membuat felt dan memiliki banyak gnome felt yang bagus dan makhluk-makhluk indah lainnya. Dia selalu mengingat kami dan bahkan menyimpan barang-barang yang dia tahu kami kumpulkan dan menyimpannya untuk kami! Mereka sekarang buka sepanjang tahun. Benar-benar layak dikunjungi.",
